    "summary": "In battle rounds 3, 4 and 5, ranged weapons of your **T’AU EMPIRE** models have **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n\nIn those rounds, when a model in a Guided unit (a [For the Greater Good](vsdata:ability/tau-empire.for-the-greater-good) rule) makes a ranged attack against a Spotted unit, you may ignore:\n\n- Some or all modifiers to its Ballistic Skill.\n- Its **Hit roll** modifiers, but only all of them together.",
